OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin heads return after viral
OL,4,AHalloween hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hairdresser has created 30 bespoke
OL,7,Fpapier-mache pumpkin heads for people
OL,8,Fto wear in a Halloween photoshoot.
OL,10,FAndrew Phimister-Double said he "had a
OL,11,Fgood laugh" when he carved out a real
OL,12,Fpumpkin and posed for photos on a bench
OL,13,Fin Abbey Fields, Kenilworth,
OL,14,FWarwickshire, around Halloween 2025 -
OL,15,Fjoining in on a viral social media
OL,16,Ftrend.
OL,18,FThe light-hearted stunt soon attracted
OL,19,Fattention, with passers-by asking to
OL,20,Fjoin in for photographs.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
