OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin heads return after viral
OL,4,AHalloween hit
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was sat with a client last year and
OL,7,Fwe thought we should do something
OL,8,Fdifferent for Halloween," he said. "We
OL,9,Fsaw there was a viral trend of people
OL,10,Fwalking around with pumpkins on their
OL,11,Fheads, but no one had done it around
OL,12,Fhere. We thought, let's do it."
